sequenceDiagram
    title Checkout
    actor C as Customer
    participant S as Shop
    participant P as Payments
    C->>S: checkout(cart)
    S->>P: charge(total)
    alt card accepted
        P--)S: approved
        S-)C: confirmation
    else declined
        P--)S: declined
        S-)C: please retry
    end
    loop every day
        S->>S: reconcile
    end
    Note over S,P: settlement happens overnight
